DECISION TheQualityGateRunsInTwoCiJobs
	SPEC "CI covers the ground of the quality audit in two jobs, the guards and the fallow audit,"
		+ "the full audit command staying that of a working copy"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/quality.yml::guards:"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/quality.yml::fallow:"
	REJECTED "Plugging the full audit command into a job: its bare branch base does not resolve in"
		+ "a CI checkout"
	REJECTED "Keeping the analysis tool out of CI"
