		PR 45

DECISION NodeFollowsReleasesWhileBunIsPinnedAndBumped
	SPEC "No workflow carries a literal Bun version: all read it from the manifest"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/quality.yml::bun-version-file: package.json"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/dependencies.yml::bun-version-file: package.json"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/ui-tests.yml::bun-version-file: package.json"
	SPEC "The Node version is an open range in the manifest"
		IMPL "package.json::\"engines\""
	SPEC "bun is declared in devDependencies at an exact version, the same version in"
		+ "packageManager, and the supported floor as an open range in engines.bun"
		IMPL "package.json::\"packageManager\""
		IMPL "package.json::\"bun\": \">=1.3.14\""
	REJECTED "Freezing Bun without a bump path: Bun is the target runtime of the CLIs"
	REJECTED "Pinning Node like Bun: the open range is the coverage of the fallback path"
	REJECTED "Declaring bun as a range: it bumps the lock at the first install, outside Dependabot"
	REJECTED "Having CI read engines.bun: an open range resolves the latest release and kills the"
		+ "cache"
	REJECTED "A guard comparing packageManager with the bumped declaration: it fails on every"
		+ "Dependabot pull request"
	REJECTED "Realigning packageManager by a bot commit: an unreviewed commit in place of a"
		+ "reviewed line"
	RATIONALE "setup-bun reads packageManager first, and Dependabot bumps only a dependency entry:"
		+ "realigning packageManager is a gesture of the Dependabot review"
	SOURCE "Owner correction"
		PR 90

DECISION DependabotTracksTwoEcosystemsInWeeklyGroups
	SPEC "The configuration tracks the CI actions and the workspace dependencies, one weekly group"
		+ "per ecosystem, with a pull request limit raised explicitly"
		IMPL ".github/dependabot.yml::open-pull-requests-limit: 10"
	SPEC "Pull requests opened by the bot are excluded from the automatic review"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/claude-code-review.yml::github.actor != 'dependabot[bot]'"
	REJECTED "The default pull request limit: five, and the queue is truncated silently"
	REJECTED "Separating production and development in the group: this ecosystem ignores it"
	REJECTED "Reviewing the bot's pull requests: they get no secret, so the job fails every time"
